 19   0000              ;; Written by Busy & Hood
 20   0000              ;; Consultations & acknowldgements & ideas: LMN, Lanex, Shrek, "Uart" authors (from Specnext)
 21   0000
 22   0000              ;; differences in Wifi behaviour on EL as opposed to MB03+:
 23   0000              ;; 1) Wifi module cannot be turned ON or OFF on a port. Turnon the computer= module turnon
 24   0000              ;; 2) max communication uart speed is always 23 and not lower
